    "finding": "The isolated prototype shifts the identified hit-flash, battlefield-wear/stamp and shockwave variants into covered, paused setup. The traced ordinary fixture has no warm/steady frame above 100 ms; destruction has no new pipeline counts. Live save state, effect counters, random states and node count were unchanged after proxy cleanup.",
