    "new_gameplay_units": 0,
    "limitations": [
      "This is a single isolated prototype, with nominal2ms sampling overhead. Results are attribution evidence, not final untraced acceptance timing.",
      "Godot user shader cache was empty before native run; OS/driver caches were not reset, so before/after wall-time improvement is not a universally cold GPU comparison.",
      "The prototype covers 28 already-loaded mesh layouts and may prepare more variants than a minimal production fix needs.",
      "Live terrain material-overlay identity was protected by code isolation but not recorded directly in this first prototype; full paused snapshot including wear history and node counts match. Add direct identity and all aftermath/projectile-pool assertions in an eventual production regression.",
      "The new movement/terrain CPU fixes were excluded via frozen source copies. Final integrated runtime requires separate verification."
    ],
    "recommended_production_scope": "After review, implement only the identified visual material preparation during a real covered/pause-safe match startup, retaining actual shader/effect fidelity and explicit cleanup; avoid using gameplay damage/death APIs or changing benchmark warm-up thresholds."
  }
